OL,3,GNEWSANearly 30,000 call for moratorium
OL,4,Aon data centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FA petition calling for a moratorium on
OL,7,Fplanning permission for data centres
OL,8,Fand battery energy storage sites (BESS)
OL,9,Fhas been rejected by the government.
OL,11,FA councillor from North Devon set up
OL,12,Fthe petition after plans emerged for an
OL,13,FAI data centre and battery energy
OL,14,Fstorage site in Torrington.
OL,16,FNearly 30,000 people signed the
OL,17,Fpetition from Cheryl Cottle-Hunkin,
OL,18,Fcabinet member for rural affairs for
OL,19,FDevon County Council, which called on
OL,20,Fthe government to pause all data centre
OL,21,Fand BESS plans outside of AI growth
OL,22,Fzones.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
