OL,3,GNEWSANearly 30,000 call for moratorium
OL,4,Aon data centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said it had no plans to
OL,7,Fpause data centres and battery storage
OL,8,Fsystems as they were vital for growth
OL,9,Fand already faced strict local planning
OL,10,Fprocesses.
